docs/progress/R87/REPORT.md:156:- D02–D04：只发现 libc++ 自身声明、定义、直接调用；未发现取址/类型依赖。
docs/progress/R87/REPORT.md:163:1. 成员函数指针类型进入普通函数参数，名字变化；
docs/progress/R87/REPORT.md:164:2. 该类型成为类型模板实参，模板实例名变化；
docs/progress/R87/REPORT.md:166:4. SFINAE/overload/constraint 若依赖这些类型或布尔值，可能间接改选实例。
docs/progress/R87/REPORT.md:168:同时，`template<auto P>` 直接传 `&function` 在本次 GCC 13/Itanium 探针中没有额外编码异常规格，符号不变；不把 R86 的“地址作为模板参数一律变化”继续泛化。变化的是**类型模板参数/包含该类型的签名**；函数地址值参数需按实际 ABI 形态区分。
docs/progress/R87/REPORT.md:175:4. 已剥离 ELF 的局部/内联符号可能不可见；没有调试信息时不能从最终机器码可靠恢复全部原始 C++ 类型表达式。
#include "layout_boundary.h"

std::deque<int>* make_payload() {
  return new std::deque<int>{11, 22, 33, 44};
}

extern "C" std::size_t provider_size(const void* payload) {
  if (payload == nullptr)
    return sizeof(std::deque<int>);
  return static_cast<const std::deque<int>*>(payload)->size();
}

extern "C" void destroy_payload(void* payload) {
  delete static_cast<std::deque<int>*>(payload);
}
#include "layout_boundary.h"

#include <cstdio>

int main() {
  std::deque<int>* payload = make_payload();
  const std::size_t producer_view = provider_size(payload);
  const std::size_t consumer_view = payload->size();
  std::printf("provider_sizeof=%zu\n", provider_size(nullptr));
  std::printf("consumer_sizeof=%zu\n", sizeof(std::deque<int>));
  std::printf("provider_view=%zu\n", producer_view);
  std::printf("consumer_view=%zu\n", consumer_view);
  destroy_payload(payload);
  return producer_view == consumer_view ? 0 : 42;
}
#pragma once

#include <cstddef>
#include <deque>

// Return types do not participate in Itanium C++ name mangling.  The producer
// and consumer therefore agree on the symbol name while compiling std::deque
// with different standard-library object layouts.
std::deque<int>* make_payload();

extern "C" std::size_t provider_size(const void* payload);
extern "C" void destroy_payload(void* payload);
